      "cat-harness:section": "tool.selection.limits",
      "prov:value": "And `--summary` / `--reason` / `--detail` are REFUSED as flags at exit 2 rather than ignored, so a caller left behind by the stdin migration is told instead of silently logging an entry with no summary."
